### 내가 작성한 리뷰 보기 API 테스트

### 1. 모든 리뷰 조회 (필터 없음)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/my-reviews?userId=1

### 2. 가게별 필터링 (반이학생마라탕마라반)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/my-reviews?userId=1&storeName=반이학생마라탕마라반

### 3. 별점별 필터링 (5점)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/my-reviews?userId=1&starRange=5

### 4. 별점별 필터링 (4점대)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/my-reviews?userId=1&starRange=4

### 5. 별점별 필터링 (3점대)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/my-reviews?userId=1&starRange=3

### 6. 가게별 + 별점별 조합 (반이학생마라탕마라반, 4점대)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/my-reviews?userId=1&storeName=반이학생마라탕마라반&starRange=4

### 7. 가게별 + 별점별 조합 (반이학생마라탕마라반, 5점)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/my-reviews?userId=1&storeName=반이학생마라탕마라반&starRange=5

